ones&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="height: 8.4pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 106.25pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;                         &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;11.092&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="height: 8.4pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 93.45pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;                     11.092&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 8.4pt"&gt;&lt;td style="height: 8.4pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 253.65pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Reserva fiscal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="height: 8.4pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 106.25pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;                          33.410&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="height: 8.4pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 93.45pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;                     33.410&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 8.4pt"&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" style="height: 8.4pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 253.65pt"/&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; height: 8.4pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 106.25pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;                    1.186.212&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; height: 8.4pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 93.45pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;                   831.941&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="Notas2" style="margin-top: 0cm"&gt;&lt;span style="color: windowtext; text-transform: none"&gt;Ganancias&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Las ganancias netas del ejercicio, y ganancias acumuladas al 31 de diciembre de 2020 y 2019 comprendían:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: red"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="text-align: center"&gt;&lt;table class="MsoNormal