ogía aplicable para dar cumplimiento al marco técnico normativo aplicable en Colombia, al 31 de diciembre de 2020:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class="MsoNormalTable" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: 5.4pt"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style="height: .05pt"&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="background: white; height: .05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; width: 220.65pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="background: white; height: .05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; width: 73.55pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Supuestos Decreto 1625 (Decreto 2131)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="background: white; height: .05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; width: 73.6pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Supuestos Beneficios a Empleados (NIC 19)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="background: white; height: .05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; width: 73.6pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Diferencia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: .05pt"&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="background: white; height: .05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; width: 220.65pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&